  "Kitsu the Fox|Rule three: never trade stuck in the middle , kya~! When price is trapped between two gas stations \u2014 a gap above and a gap below \u2014 it just bounces around. That is a no-trade day.": "dac7ac335480d27c.mp3",
  "Kitsu the Fox|So learn these two words, kya~. A retracement is just a rest: price steps back, but the last higher low still holds. A reversal is the real thing: a body closes past that step and the stairs start going the other way.": "2f92d8c77af06a52.mp3",
  "Kitsu the Fox|So the real question isn't 'how do I never lose?' It's 'how do I keep my losses SMALL?' Small scratches heal fast. Giant wounds end the adventure, kya~!": "da41dd4ae675d025.mp3",
  "Kitsu the Fox|Step two, kya~! Drop to the 15-minute chart. It has to agree with the big chart \u2014 same direction. If the hour says DOWN and the 15-minute says UP, that is an argument, not a trade!": "65ec3e7e208f5762.mp3",
