  "Rival Kazuo|After lunch things go sleepy\u2026 then comes Power Hour : 3 PM to 4 PM , the last hour before the closing bell. The big players finish their business for the day, and the market wakes up fast.": "b5d90c8b838c32b1.mp3",
  "Rival Kazuo|And it has to be a real push. A candle that pokes a tiny bit past the old high and closes right back under it? I do not trust that. I want a strong body that closes beyond it . One signal with no confirmation is just a maybe.": "afd4b80e6439e9a5.mp3",
