  "Rival Kazuo|And the sneaky one: the failed break . A candle pokes above the last candle's high\u2026 then closes back down inside. It tried to go up and failed. That poke is a trap, and the snap-back is the tell. (A money shooter is exactly this!)": "0c5423b0e471b791.mp3",
