  "Rival Kazuo|Demon two: Revenge Trading . You lose a trade, get angry, and instantly slam into another trade to 'win it back.' That's not a strategy \u2014 that's the demon driving. After a loss: breathe, review, reset.": "412c57ff9e025a31.mp3",
