  "Rival Kazuo|I met it once. A video: 'My trading bot made 2,000 gold in THIRTY MINUTES!' My heart raced. I almost sent the stranger my Koins to learn his secret. Then Sensei made me watch the video again... carefully.": "90e127735a85d840.mp3",
  "Rival Kazuo|If a zone is weak and didn't do something new, when price returns, it won't hold. Price runs straight through it like a bowling ball through paper cups! Dad calls this the 'Down Go Frazier!' rule. Don't mark them!": "8b7335b56e9d7c3a.mp3",
  "Rival Kazuo|If price leaps overnight and leaves a GAP , it acts like a breakout-retest: price dips back to fill the gap, grabs GAS (about halfway in), then continues. Mark it from the body of the last candle before the jump.": "487bbb7b2f3e0c1b.mp3",
  "Rival Kazuo|Last ones. P&L is your profit and loss \u2014 your score. Risk is what you lose if your stop gets hit. And R is one unit of that risk: risk $20 to make $60 and you made 3R .": "560d026b87c30ece.mp3",
  "Rival Kazuo|Notice I said body . A wick poking through is just price sniffing around. A body closing beyond the level means price actually did something new. Bodies first, wicks second.": "d123dae9031081b2.mp3",
