  "Sensei Hoshi|A trend is not a feeling. It is a staircase , and you can count the steps. Four little labels are all you need: HH, HL, LH, LL .": "f5bf7ff0df7f0a0b.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|An uptrend makes higher hills and higher valleys \u2014 climbing a mountain. A downtrend makes lower hills and lower valleys \u2014 sliding down. And sometimes the market moves sideways , just resting.": "c267e9d678eba004.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|And a gap is strongest the first time price comes back to it. That first visit is the one most likely to bounce. Every visit after that wears it down, like knocking on the same door again and again \u2014 in the end it opens.": "6305927a3b9298f0.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|And beware the double-edged sword of futures: leverage . It makes wins bigger AND losses bigger. That is exactly why real futures are for trained adults only \u2014 and why the shield matters above all. Quiz, then the Shield Trial awaits in the dojo!": "f937257967008b6d.mp3",
