  "|A real NQ morning, August 28, 2026, on five-minute candles. One level was marked before the open: the overnight low.": "92a4d4aeb98d3c69.mp3",
  "|A real NQ morning, February 16, 2026, on five-minute candles. One level was marked before the open: the middle of yesterday.": "28f3d5f0ab23c427.mp3",
  "|A real NQ morning, February 26, 2026, on five-minute candles. One level was marked before the open: yesterday's low.": "99c4db38fb9c586b.mp3",
