  "|All three pillars together \u2014 that's the way of the Trade Master.": "b9370b4b0ac58b48.mp3",
  "|All three together: reading the chart, managing risk, and managing yourself.": "3d5a2196991b74ef.mp3",
  "|Almost every candle goes up at SOME point \u2014 that's not what colour means.": "550789b73830c768.mp3",
  "|Almost every candle goes up at some point \u2014 that is not what the color means.": "1182b1023cfa8432.mp3",
  "|Also called a stop hunt: price runs into the cluster of orders, triggers them, and often reverses.": "4f634e34dfd231c1.mp3",
  "|An NQ tick is 0.25 of a point, so four ticks make one point.": "ba888ca9ae5ced93.mp3",
  "|An engulfing candle (outside bar) takes out both sides. Expect price to continue the way of the LAST side taken \u2014 here, up.": "ec688703b26c183d.mp3",
  "|An engulfing candle, also called an outside bar , takes out both sides of the previous candle's range \u2014 its low and its high \u2014 before it closes. Expect continuation in the direction of the last side taken out.": "35544f328a74bb84.mp3",
  "|An uptrend looks like...": "72793fa1c26716e2.mp3",
  "|An uptrend makes higher highs and higher lows \u2014 each peak and each dip sits above the last. A downtrend makes lower highs and lower lows. A market going sideways is doing neither.": "e877a2c9edc0044f.mp3",
  "|And look what happened next. Price kept going. Without that stop, a small loss becomes a huge one. And remember the big chart? The hour was heading down. We traded against it. Never fight the hour.": "97148e2502decdd9.mp3",
  "|And now? Four candles this time.": "6516e49f3c35b520.mp3",
  "|And the rule that overrides the rest: trade only in the direction of the higher timeframe . If the hourly chart is in a downtrend, only the bearish gaps matter; ignore the bullish ones.": "dcd1c70e89d85fc8.mp3",
  "|And the target is the NEXT line on the chart: the middle of yesterday. That is 56.25 points away. We risk 36.25 to try to make 56.25.": "0a9abe667595ee8d.mp3",
  "|And the target is the NEXT line on the chart: the overnight low. That is 29.75 points away. We risk 16.50 to try to make 29.75.": "5a526b43e712f385.mp3",
  "|And the target is the NEXT line on the chart: the overnight low. That is 91.25 points away. We risk 41.50 to try to make 91.25.": "6b402cfa2aa7ec1e.mp3",
  "|And the target is the NEXT line on the chart: yesterday's high. That is 98.75 points away. We risk 45.75 to try to make 98.75.": "073a4bf53d2576bd.mp3",
  "|And this one?": "adaf8dfced49d3a3.mp3",
  "|Arriving at the level is Behavior. You still wait for the Reaction candle to close.": "dc0e9057fd983b28.mp3",
