  "|Asia builds a quiet box. London wakes up around 3 AM and often makes the first real move \u2014 sometimes by poking past Asia's box.": "0c365fd10a677f89.mp3",
  "|Asia often trades sideways in a narrow range. Note its top and bottom \u2014 the Asia high and Asia low \u2014 because later sessions frequently return to them.": "7b42e8030b1d5f6d.mp3",
