  "|Asia usually trades sideways and builds a quiet box. Remember the top and bottom of that box.": "c9fd6439eafb9585.mp3",
  "|At three in the morning, something pokes past the quiet night range, and snaps back. Kazuo frowns. That was not an accident, he says. Something is hunting out there.": "d39388c7d147fd88.mp3",
  "|B \u2014 Behavior (the idea). The higher timeframe (HTF) \u2014 the 4-hour and 1-hour charts \u2014 takes priority . Check it every hour. Mark the respected zones at the highs and lows, and state: 'I want to see price get here.' That is your Behavior target.": "19027c2ab3a119d3.mp3",
  "|BNR = Bounce & Reject (his favorite) and Break & Retest. Both off a level that was already set up.": "0904dcf415c47e1c.mp3",
  "|BNR covers Bounce & Reject (the preferred one) and Break & Retest. Both are taken off a level that was already marked.": "4976420febbd5673.mp3",
  "|Back in Stage 1 you found higher steps and lower steps on a plain line. Candles make the same steps \u2014 you just have to look past the colours.": "f523b4b84850b20a.mp3",
  "|Before any charts, a quick check on percentages. Almost every risk question in trading comes down to what fraction of your account is at stake.": "0fc49afb192d7768.mp3",
  "|Before any trade, ask which way the structure is stepping. Buy in an uptrend, sell in a downtrend, and do not trade against the structure.": "5b12551bf0f1f6b3.mp3",
  "|Before candles, before charts \u2014 Koins. Every trader question is really a pile question.": "89ce75a34ec7736e.mp3",
  "|Before reading a chart, learn how the money is counted. In futures you do not buy shares. You trade contracts \u2014 one contract is one unit of exposure to the price.": "a8f1f7bdfc8e3244.mp3",
  "|Before the day starts, a trader draws a few lines. Yesterday's high. Yesterday's low. The middle. Those lines are where the action happens.": "d5dad5dfe9690ffe.mp3",
  "|Before the session begins, a trader marks a small number of key levels \u2014 the prices where a reaction is most likely.": "fa5478dc5f4ff6f1.mp3",
  "|Behavior, Reaction, Execution, Alignment, Discipline \u2014 Dad's one recipe, every trade.": "654641b1357caf58.mp3",
