  "|Closed higher than it opened means buyers won that candle. Closed lower means sellers won.": "54fd880be8436fad.mp3",
  "|Closed higher than it opened means the buyers took ground. The body shows how much.": "f340e1755c97c236.mp3",
  "|Color tells you direction. A green candle means the price closed higher than it opened \u2014 buyers won that period. A red candle means it closed lower \u2014 sellers won. Sellers are nicknamed \"bears\".": "a815af56fcada521.mp3",
