  "|Every hero needs armour. A trader's armour is one decision made early : how many Koins am I willing to lose on this one trade?": "9c6e32f4f59b7d26.mp3",
  "|Every trade has three prices. The entry is where you get in. The stop is where you exit if you are wrong. The target is where you exit if you are right. All three are decided before you enter.": "9049a8e2be2f667d.mp3",
  "|Every trading app in the world shows yesterday's range. That's why those lines act like walls and the ones you invent don't.": "e4a1a59732772e2e.mp3",
  "|Everyone knows the normal way to win: buy cheap, sell dear . Buy a card for 8 Koins, sell it for 12, you're up 4. Easy.": "2cbddd9578f93971.mp3",
  "|Everyone loses sometimes. Champions just make sure the losses stay tiny.": "451effd24d598565.mp3",
