  "|Everyone sees the touch. Information everyone has at the same instant gives you no advantage.": "1941ccdb9c68dcda.mp3",
  "|Everyone sees the touch. The touch is free information and free information is worthless.": "80f2de2e8475d21a.mp3",
  "|Exactly! It's a promise about a future trade \u2014 and traders trade the promises themselves.": "55c48ac7225232b9.mp3",
  "|Exactly. A ceiling breaking means one side finally ran out of fighters. That's often when the biggest moves start.": "4d0ca89ec3def16d.mp3",
  "|Exactly. One candle is a moment. Several in a row is a story .": "5f89e640df07ae6f.mp3",
  "|Exactly. One candle is a single moment. Several in a row is a sequence you can read.": "511313efb01eae71.mp3",
  "|Exactly. Real futures use leverage and real Koins... er, dollars. Train for years, study hard, and only adults with money they can afford to lose should ever try.": "dfa8ab6fef53d043.mp3",
  "|Falling stops there and price bounces: that is support.": "377b7654af09dd99.mp3",
  "|Fast arrivals are more likely to be the grab, not less.": "fc5090fa2967fe27.mp3",
  "|Few trades, carefully chosen. Overtrading steadily drains an account.": "bdbf5ea14a297f1d.mp3",
  "|Finally, leverage : futures let you control a large position with a small deposit, which magnifies gains and losses equally. That is why real futures are high-risk and why the stop-loss comes first. Take the quiz, then the Trial of the Shield exercise in the practice arena.": "6b56432dec974f72.mp3",
  "|Finish the surfer's wisdom: 'The trend is your...'": "db7860bd3dd0dcbc.mp3",
