  "|First move: trick. Second move: truth. Wait and watch the reaction.": "448622d09d1faf53.mp3",
  "|First rule: start on the higher timeframe . Look at the 1-hour and 4-hour charts. Has price been rejected from a major level or a gap there? If it has not, there is no trade.": "6c7b449173dde91b.mp3",
  "|Five checks. Behavior. Reaction. Execution. Alignment. Discipline. The whole method, in one trade. This is what all the training was for.": "905b01f0dd249822.mp3",
