  "|Markets tend toward balance . A fast, one-sided move leaves an unbalanced gap behind, and price tends to be drawn back to fill it. That is why we say price has a goal \u2014 it is being pulled toward a level, not wandering.": "8e9956ebfdb6c44d.mp3",
  "|Meet the villain that hunts impatient traders. Learn its trap.": "d14b992fd2b2b9f6.mp3",
