  "|Never act while the candle is still forming \u2014 it can look like a hammer with ten seconds left and close as something else. Wait for the candle to close.": "00e38b268b9c9fa3.mp3",
  "|Never add to a losing trade. That is how one bad idea takes the whole account.": "5cc6ef79a0873942.mp3",
